<form class="tool-form" onsubmit="return false"><label class="tool-field"><span>Your IELTS overall band</span><input id="band" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="e.g. 6.5" maxlength="4"></label></form>
<div class="tool-result" id="out" aria-live="polite"></div>
<div class="tool-note">Values come from the official IELTS comparison table (PTE Academic scores are on a 10–90 scale). Scores are approximate; check with your institution. The table starts at band 5.0 and ends at 8.5.</div>
